[en.FOCUS_C18_000_MANUFACTURE]
Made in the East

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_MANUFACTURE_desc]
Eastern region has developed agriculture, but its industrial foundation is weak. Adjacent to the Fluttershy Harbour, it is necessary to give full play to the geographical advantages of the eastern region, develop small-scale, private hoof industries, manufacture small commodities, and improve the poverty status of the eastern region.

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_MANUFACTURE_TOOLTIP]
Unlock a series of decisions in §YDream by the Fire§!: §YAgriculture to Manufacturing§!

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_MANUFACTURE]
东方蹄工业

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_MANUFACTURE_desc]
东部地区的农业发达，但工业基础薄弱。近邻柔柔港，我们有必要充分发挥东部地区的地理位置优势，发展小型、民营蹄工业，制造小商品，改善东部地区的贫困状态。

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_MANUFACTURE_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y黄粱一梦§!中的系列决议：§Y农业转制造业§!

